---
import TrustPageLayout from '../layouts/TrustPageLayout.astro';
---

<TrustPageLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How ThePickleballCourt.ca handles information when you visit our site."
	canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
	<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 30, 2026</p>
	<p>
		This privacy policy describes how ThePickleballCourt.ca (“we”, “us”) handles information when you visit our
		website. {'{{ TODO: confirm }}'} — have a Canadian privacy lawyer review before treating this as final legal advice.
	</p>
	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Standard server/CDN logs (IP address, user agent, pages requested) via our hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages)</li>
		<li>
			Optional Google Analytics 4 (GA4) when enabled — page views, approximate location/device, and outbound
			affiliate click events (product id + destination link). IP anonymization is enabled in our GA4 config.
		</li>
		<li>Information you voluntarily send via email or a contact form</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Cookies</h2>
	<p>
		We may use essential cookies required to operate the site. When GA4 is enabled, Google may set analytics cookies
		under Google’s policies. Affiliate destination sites may set their own cookies under their policies when you
		leave our site.
	</p>
	<h2>How we use information</h2>
	<p>
		To operate and improve the site, understand aggregate traffic and which guides/products drive outbound clicks,
		respond to messages, and comply with law. We do not sell personal information. {'{{ TODO: confirm }}'}
	</p>
	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Privacy questions: see our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
	</p>
</TrustPageLayout>
